{
  "version": 1,
  "selector": ".data-management",
  "html": "<section class=\"data-management\" data-storage-view=\"overview\" aria-label=\"本地数据管理\"><header class=\"data-management-header\"><h2 id=\"data-management-title\">数据管理</h2><button type=\"button\" class=\"data-refresh\" aria-label=\"刷新数据管理\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-refresh-cw\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8\"></path><path d=\"M21 3v5h-5\"></path><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16\"></path><path d=\"M8 16H3v5\"></path></svg><span>刷新</span></button></header><div class=\"data-management-scroll\"><div class=\"data-error\" role=\"alert\">Controlled inventory failure<button type=\"button\">重试读取</button></div><section class=\"data-backup-section\" aria-label=\"本地备份\"><h3>本地备份</h3><div class=\"data-backup-actions\"><button type=\"button\">导入备份…</button><button type=\"button\">导出完整备份…</button></div><p class=\"data-explanation\">包含已保存的备忘录、文件夹、设置和全部登记附件原文件，其他窗口未提交的草稿不在备份中。合并导入，冲突保留为副本，并应用备份设置。</p></section><section class=\"sync-settings\" aria-labelledby=\"sync-settings-title\" data-sync-state=\"disabled\" aria-busy=\"false\"><header class=\"sync-heading\"><h3 id=\"sync-settings-title\">设备同步</h3><span class=\"sync-state sync-state-disabled\">未开启</span><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"刷新同步状态\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-refresh-cw\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8\"></path><path d=\"M21 3v5h-5\"></path><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16\"></path><path d=\"M8 16H3v5\"></path></svg></button></header><p class=\"sync-description\">在你的设备间同步本地备忘录。可使用局域网、虚拟内网或隧道服务地址。</p><div class=\"sync-live\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">尚无成功同步记录</div><div class=\"sync-group\"><label class=\"sync-field\"><span>本机名称</span><input aria-label=\"同步设备名称\" maxlength=\"120\" placeholder=\"例如：我的 Mac 或手机\" value=\"\" style=\"\"></label><label class=\"sync-field\"><span>服务端口</span><input aria-label=\"同步服务端口\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"5\" value=\"49632\" style=\"\"></label><div class=\"sync-actions\"><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radio\"><path d=\"M4.9 19.1C1 15.2 1 8.8 4.9 4.9\"></path><path d=\"M7.8 16.2c-2.3-2.3-2.3-6.1 0-8.5\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M16.2 7.8c2.3 2.3 2.3 6.1 0 8.5\"></path><path d=\"M19.1 4.9C23 8.8 23 15.1 19.1 19\"></path></svg>开启此设备同步服务</button><button type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg>加入同步</button></div></div></section></div></section>",
